notes:        Generated by the contributor with Adobe After Effects 2026 (one scripted change per file, or for 977 one scripted batch) as their own test data for the effectcraft-aep tests; contains only synthetic project structure, no third-party footage (the footage link names a contributor-made test image that is not included; its stored path and host name were replaced by neutral ones of the same length), presets, templates or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used. The project container is byte-identical to the generated file apart from that path; the XMP packet after it was replaced by the (smaller) packet of the base project to keep the fixtures small.
